assumption = "The Human workspace lockfile is outside the hosting paths. It is left unchanged and the Dockerfile retains --locked. bash -n platform/hosted/tests/beta-cluster.sh platform/hosted/tests/topology-check.sh exits 0 in qual-logs/au29/bash-n-final.log. bash platform/hosted/tests/beta-cluster.sh render exits 0 in render.log. python3 qual-logs/au29/check-human-manifest.py exits 0 in human-manifest.log, validating explicit env names against the service source, the readiness route, rendered images and beta CA verification for short/full Service DNS names and localhost. bash tools/ci/beta-contract-check.sh exits 0 in beta-contract.log. cg spec lint exits 0 with zero errors and nine existing warnings in spec-lint-final.log. timeout 60s cg review exits 124 in cg-review.log; cg guard exits 0 with advisory task-scope differences in cg-guard.log. These checks do not qualify a Human runtime."
severity = "blocker"

