assumption = "The selected disposable identity is layerx-au29-human with no owner kubeconfig or inherited LayerX overrides. CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 MAKEFLAGS=-j4, LAYERX_TEST_NATIVE_BIN_DIR=/root/lx-lanes/native-bin, LAYERX_BETA_MIN_FREE_GIB=30 and LAYERX_BETA_FORBIDDEN_CHAIN_ID=125 apply. No kind cluster or pods are created, no Human readiness probe executes and qualification exports are not written because env_write is not reached. The guard refuses contract transactions on the forbidden chain before deploy-contracts.sh; that step is not reached. The persistent Paxeer chain, existing Redis and shared runtime are untouched. Disk evidence is in qual-logs/au29/disk-before.log, disk-before-exact.log, disk-after-exact.log and disk-after-cleanup.log. Supplementary make platform-beta-cluster-down exits 0 in qual-logs/au29/teardown.log. remaining-cluster-containers.log and remaining-kind-containers.log are both empty; this proves cleanup and absence, not teardown of a deployed cluster. No complete cluster gate or ready Human deployment is claimed."
severity = "blocker"
