assumption = "The program listener must publish the real authenticated maintenance attachment using lxp_daemon_receipt_authority_batch_maintenance, and the account-state head serializer must handle authenticated maintenance records without ordinary receipt decoding. These native producer changes are outside the assigned consumer paths. No synthetic attachment, replacement root, skipped assertion, native producer change or relay fallback is introduced. LAYERX_TEST_NATIVE_BIN_DIR=/root/lx-lanes/native-bin; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 MAKEFLAGS=-j4 RAYON_NUM_THREADS=4; PATH includes qual-logs/n26/python/bin and /root/.foundry/bin."
