observed = "formerly observation.5.1.9. formerly observation.5.1.3 (renumbered after rebase). formerly observation.5.1.focused-human-real-stack-prerequisite. Read-only diagnosis: release_runner.py:576-577 requires LAYERX_QUALIFICATION_REAL_STACK=1 before real evidence collection. Task 5.1 do_1 includes human-qualify-faults but supplies no stack provisioning step. Task 5.2 do_1 explicitly starts the components and do_2 supplies LAYERX_QUALIFICATION_REAL_STACK=1; task 5.2 requires 5.1. The focused runner on lane/beta-qualify-focused invokes the command and records failure; it does not provision or assert a real stack. That runner is not yet present on the measured lane/native base. Evidence: qual-logs/r15/runner-diagnosis.log."
assumption = "Task 5.1 needs an already provisioned authorized real stack to pass this gate; its current contract does not instruct the runner to create it. Task 5.2 owns setup, creating a prerequisite ordering issue for the orchestrator. Setting the flag alone does not establish a stack. Runner and task statuses remain unchanged; make human-qualify-faults was not rerun."
severity = "blocker"

