observed = "formerly observation.6.8.10. formerly observation.6.8.cluster-lock-reconciled-disk-stop. The lock reconciliation from 351efdea07733d0c806a0da1e28a99fa078b468c applies cleanly. cargo metadata --locked --offline --manifest-path human/Cargo.toml exits 0 in qual-logs/au30/human-metadata.log. On ca176adaf883, make platform-hosted-topology-check platform-beta-cluster-up platform-beta-cluster-down passes both topology parsers and all retained regressions, builds testnet-control, gateway, faucet and program-registry, then the owned disk monitor terminates the command with SIGTERM while Webhooks extracts its Rust base image. Process exit -15, shell-equivalent 143; exact result qual-logs/au30/task-6.8-result.json. Verbatim monitor output: disk floor reached: 27 GiB; terminating this command process group. Verbatim make output: make: *** [platform/Makefile.inc:185: platform-beta-cluster-up] Terminated. Verbatim Docker output: ERROR: failed to build: failed to solve: Canceled: context canceled. The monitor polls every five seconds against a 30 GiB threshold; 27 GiB is the observed stop sample, not a lowered threshold. Logs: qual-logs/au30/task-6.8.log and build-layerx-webhooks.log; all four completed image IDs and references are in images.log, with each build log retained beside it."
assumption = "CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 MAKEFLAGS=-j4 LAYERX_TEST_NATIVE_BIN_DIR=/root/lx-lanes/native-bin; LAYERX_BETA_KUBECONFIG unset, disposable identity layerx-au30-human, LAYERX_BETA_MIN_FREE_GIB=30 and LAYERX_BETA_FORBIDDEN_CHAIN_ID=125. The repository build_context and docker build invocation are unchanged. Human is not reached and has no new image digest; no kind cluster or pod exists, no readiness probe runs and no qualification exports are written. Supplementary make platform-beta-cluster-down exits 0 in qual-logs/au30/teardown.log. remaining-cluster-containers.log and remaining-kind-containers.log are empty. This proves cleanup and absence, not teardown of a deployed cluster. df -h / reports 69G free before the exact command, 31G after the interrupted bring-up and 32G after teardown; raw logs disk-before-exact.log, disk-after-bringup-attempt.log and disk-after-teardown.log. No persistent Paxeer, host Redis or shared runtime action occurs. The chain-125 transaction guard is retained and never reached. More disk headroom is required before the Human build and exact cluster gate can finish; production Human provider and custody inputs remain unqualified. git diff --check exits 0 in qual-logs/au30/diff-check.log; cg spec lint exits 0 with zero errors and nine existing warnings in qual-logs/au30/spec-lint.log."
severity = "blocker"

