observed = "DepositProofVerifier::obtain consumes a PublishedDepositProof but does not fetch its signed registration or inclusion path. The movement wire carries DebitExpectation for checkpoint lookup but no authenticated membership producer endpoint. Finalized exit balance evidence also needs a principal-bound producer contract."
