observed = "Human policy assembly can derive deployed custody addresses and translate a version-2 registry, but secrets_generate currently copies an unversioned example registry. The cluster driver has no producer for the bound Human principal policy, owner authority, recovery commitment, purpose catalog, consumed limit state, checkpoint registration authority, custody domain or verified Programs journal. The authority documents deliberate refusal of identity, capability, budget and key-policy evidence without state/checkpoint proofs. Movement documents an incomplete online deposit/withdrawal/exit evidence producer and readiness remains false. Configuring binaries, protected files and two HTTPS endpoints cannot manufacture those facts."
assumption = "The missing real evidence producers and the canonical version-2 registry must be integrated before human_policy_publish can succeed. Material assembly refuses absent or incompatible inputs. No bound, proof check or readiness refusal is weakened; full cluster qualification remains external to this deployment change."
