observed = "At revision 70bf8bf3 all fourteen commands from the existing qualification table were rerun with CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=16 and MAKEFLAGS=-j16. make build, both build/unit/integration combinations, root make test-daemon-guarantor, root make test-daemon-finality-authority, the halt_on_error UBSan unit variant, the real-contract settlement script, root guarantor provisioning, shell syntax, guarantor topology, beta-ledger-check and git diff --check exit 0. make test-daemon-guarantor-sanitize exits 2 because AddressSanitizer is not first in the initial library list. make platform-hosted-topology-check exits 2 with the existing twenty non-guarantor failures across fifty-two edges; all seven guarantor negative mutations pass. Exact commands, exit codes and per-command evidence paths are retained in qual-logs/gp1/gp1d-gates.json; command logs are qual-logs/gp1/gp1d-final-*.log."
assumption = "The real-daemon producer integration is qualified. Settlement evidence publication and its extended fetch_published tests remain blocked by observation 6.1.44; the passing settlement test covers the existing registration path only. Sanitizer checks remain enabled. Docker, image, kubectl, kind, Secret application and live-cluster gates were not run."
severity = "note"

[observation.6.1.47]
task = "6.1"
file = "src/state/lxp_state_root.c include/layerx/lxp_ledger.h platform/hosted/paxeer/deploy-contracts.sh"
symbol = "state_node_hash leaves_proof lxp_state_root phase_finalize"
observed = "The proposed settlement witness version 2 carries key/value bytes and two sibling arrays but no layer-A leaf index or direction bits. Native leaves_root sorts leaves by key and hashes ordered left/right children, duplicating the final child at odd widths. Existing leaves_proof stores both leaf_index and leaf_count. A key alone does not determine its rank among the actual module leaves, and sibling hashes do not reveal their key order. The composite layer additionally hashes the module-id key and subtree root as a length-prefixed state leaf before its state-node path. The deployment finalization script still requires EVIDENCE_VERSION 1 and is outside the assigned settlement paths."
assumption = "The fixed wire encoding needs an explicit path-position representation before a deterministic path-fold verifier can mirror the native tree. Carrying native leaf indices and counts also supports depth, index-bound and odd-duplication checks. Sorted hash pairs, an assumed zero index or an undocumented direction-search verifier are not adopted. Source implementation and runtime qualification remain unperformed; no native root or existing verification check is changed. Deployment finalization requires its path owner to update the version expectation with the contract rollout."
severity = "blocker"

[observation.6.1.48]
task = "6.1"
file = "src/state/lxp_state_root.c src/modules/asset/lx_asset_state.c src/modules/asset/lx_asset_registry.c src/modules/asset/lx_asset_custody.c"
symbol = "universal_leaves lx_asset_state_root module_state_root lx_asset_withdraw_request"
observed = "The approved version-2 witness adds leaf_index_a, leaf_count_a and leaf_count_b and preserves the module wrapper. A separate fact-commitment gap remains. universal_leaves commits the account registry as the value of account-tree in module zero; balances need account inclusion, account-tree inclusion and the module wrapper path. lx_asset_state_root constructs a separate asset/account tree but the registered asset module_state_root calls lxp_state_subtree_root instead, so that standalone tree is not the checkpoint commitment. lx_asset_withdraw_request appends only to a caller-owned lx_withdrawal_store, which lxp_state_root does not consume. The registered asset activity table has no withdrawal activity. lx_account_state_leaf_material includes no EVM payout recipient."
assumption = "The two-path codec can prove existing module KV and universal leaves but cannot represent account inclusion or bind an uncommitted recipient or withdrawal store. Native commitment changes or an explicitly approved third account path and recipient authorization are required outside the settlement-owned implementation files. Generic proof verification does not establish a settlement fact. Publication version constants and existing claim checks must remain paired with the existing rollout until the missing fact path is implemented; empty settlement vectors cannot stand in for account balances that exist."
severity = "blocker"

