symbol = "registry_deployment_produce cluster_producer_signs_built_program_for_live_treasury"
observed = "The cluster producer builds the repository escrow artifact and executes signing inside the node. It reads the protected bootstrap treasury key in place, binds its public key and DID, fetches the protocol-3 account sequence with layerxctl read-state and encodes a NativeProgramDeploy carrying the exact built ABI-2 artifact. Only the signed activity leaves the node; private signing material stays in memory. Host publication is mode 0600, no-clobber and fsynced before registry ingress. The exact embedded producer passes canonical NativeProgramDeploy roundtrip, artifact-byte equality and real funded native deployment; altered signatures and invalid artifacts refuse. make programs-reference-escrow layerxctl, registry format check, locked all-targets Clippy, locked registry tests, eighteen Human Python tests, shell syntax and beta-ledger-check pass. Logs: qual-logs/reg2/reg2e-producer-build.log, reg2e-producer-native.log, reg2e-producer-fmt.log, reg2e-producer-clippy.log, reg2e-producer-registry.log, reg2e-producer-human.log, reg2e-producer-shell.log and reg2e-producer-ledger.log."
