observed = "The native executor already waits on queue_changed. LNI minor 5 permits a publication-wait selector that waits on queue/publication notifications up to the request deadline. Minor-5 unknown resolution makes one waiting lookup without a sleep/retry interval; legacy peer behavior remains replay-compatible. Optional LAYERX_PAY_TIMING records native preparation, commit, publication and history microseconds. No before/after native microsecond samples or hosted funded-SEND percentile rerun were obtained. Existing hosted bootstrap generators still emit the old metadata-free genesis request."
assumption = "The supplied hosted latency baseline is not reproduced by local kernel tests. The hosted owner must provide a version-2 bootstrap request with explicit asset metadata and named fee schedule, then run the funded SEND publication/history path and daemon restart matrix. Instrumentation and source removal of polling do not qualify the latency target."
severity = "blocker"

