observed = "python3 tests/daemon/pay1.py --output qual-logs/pay1/runtime-g3 --bin-dir build/bin --client qual-logs/pay1/pay1-client --poll exits 1. Fresh layerxd and its real authority replica accept native registration; the client verifies its sequencer signature. Asset list/detail tags 32/33, fee tags 34/35 and DID enumeration tags 7/8 produce identical bytes before and after process restart. Assertions verify native asset id, issuer, supplied salt, cap 10000, unpaused state and zero supply. The next signed account_open receipt returns -208: asset_execute_typed looks up the actor main account before binding the receipt, and lxp_ctx_bind_ledger_receipt independently requires it. Fresh genesis contains only system accounts. Evidence: qual-logs/pay1/pay1g-runtime-poll-r2.log, runtime-g3/0-register.log, runtime-g3/0-before.log, runtime-g3/0-after.log and runtime-g3/1-open.log."
assumption = "The native source comparison against 508ee475 exits 0 for src, include and cmd; pay1g-native-base-comparison.log records identical sources, not a separate base runtime invocation. The module-context binding is outside the granted paths and remains intact. Opening, mint, burn, grant issue/revoke, positive DID account enumeration and their restart assertions remain unqualified. The harness uses real binaries and real signatures; it does not manufacture a main account or bypass the receipt assertion."
severity = "blocker"

[observation.3.7.60]
task = "3.7"
