symbol = "sign_manifest validate lxp_snapshot_store_read load_genesis_settlement_anchor"
observed = "The existing builder signing path signs a genesis manifest whose validation requires zero-balance system accounts. The snapshot store carries sequence, canonical root, receipt root and a snapshot digest, without a signer signature. The daemon independently requires the finalized bootstrap registration to match the signed genesis receipt root. Renaming a retired issuance account therefore cannot be made an accepted post-genesis root by rerunning the current genesis signer or recomputing the snapshot digest. Source excerpts: qual-logs/pay1/pay1g-migration-boundary.log."
assumption = "The operator snapshot migration command and real signed migration fixture are not implemented or qualified. A consumable migration needs coordinated authorization and verification in the genesis/snapshot interfaces, snapshot storage and daemon recovery, which are outside the granted builder and state paths. Existing root, signature, account-kind and balance checks remain unchanged; no newly authorized migration root is claimed."
severity = "blocker"

