observed = "Asset admission now records whether the authenticated actor main account exists. Account-open binds the derived principal id, activity, authorization, staged account, zero balance and zero sequence when that native main account is absent; the existing account path retains its balance and sequence checks. The real daemon matrix registers an asset, opens issuer and recipient per-asset accounts, mints, burns, issues and revokes a payer grant, performs 20 Sends, verifies every sequencer-signed receipt and compares committed Asset, fee and DID account proof bytes after each stop/start. Supply progresses 0, 9000 and 8900; final balances are 8880 and 20. Issuer, supplied salt, cap 10000, unpaused state and roots remain identical across restart. Evidence: qual-logs/pay1/pay1h-runtime-fixed.log and runtime-h8; the command exits 0."
