observed = "SendDebit exposes every inner debit field and creates a disclosure-bound SigningRequest for the exact lxp_send_authorization_message preimage under SignaturePreimage. The shared envelope encoder separately binds identity_sequence; the source sequence is not required to equal it. Native C fixture generation uses explicit field values, native authorization messages, domain hashes, OpenSSL Ed25519 signatures and lxp_receive_encode/lxp_send_encode. Command: bash agent/crates/layerx-crypto/tests/generate-native-payments.sh. Evidence: qual-logs/pay2/d-native-command.log, d-native-tests.log and d-x402-check.log. Rust and the separate 402 codec reproduce the native receive and payer-grant bytes exactly."
assumption = "This native source has no public lxp_payer_grant_encode symbol; the committed 346-byte grant fixture is the exact grant segment emitted by lxp_receive_encode. The native public grant encoder must be integrated from its owning source before that exact named entry point can be independently qualified. Shared crypto signing is qualified separately from funded gateway execution."
severity = "note"

