assumption = "The gateway must expose a separate authenticated identity next_sequence read, or specify its existing public transport route. Account sequence must not substitute for identity sequence. Complete typed monetary and metadata fields require the gateway result schemas. Native-backed enumeration, asset reads and fee estimation remain explicitly unavailable in the reference. No live wallet completion is claimed."
