observed = "The source-only grant, draw and renewal harness cannot start without modifying or integrating its source checkout. Its build script resolves the core fixture from CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR and then requires /root/lx-lanes/pay6/build/tests/bridge/sign-credit, which is absent; the compatible helper exists only in this checkout. Evidence: qual-logs/pay4/l/pay6-402lxp-harness-online-attempt.log. The cluster registry source remains an unversioned interoperability example whose Asset declaration is ordinal 1 only, so it does not provision the hosted admission set. The full core run otherwise passes its unit tests and eleven boundary tests; the retained authenticated empty DID snapshot assertion expects unavailability, and the supervisor reset fixture retains native result -402 from the metadata-free hosted bootstrap. Evidence: qual-logs/pay4/l/core-all-tests.log."
