observed = "The conformance package resolves @sidiora/layerx-buyer-middleware and @sidiora/layerx-merchant-middleware through the exports entry of each workspace manifest, which names dist/index.d.ts, so its build fails with TS2307 for both until those two workspaces have been built; the card's gate builds the seller and agent packages only. With them built, the conformance build succeeds and the payments suite runs 21 tests, of which the persistent draw registration test fails with ENOENT from mkdtempSync on qual-logs/pay6. 38eef9e37 places that temporary directory under the repository qual-logs tree but calls mkdtempSync directly, where the equivalent Rust harness in platform/hosted/authority/tests/human_tls.rs calls create_dir_all on its own qual-logs subdirectory first. With the parent directory present all 21 tests pass. Evidence: qual-logs/rebase-205-12c.log."
