observed = "The real token-lxt20 WASM reference stages fixed-supply issuer funding and settles transfers between per-owner program-derived accounts. Shared token balances, allowance decrements and transfer effects use the runtime transaction. All seven methods execute in runtime unit tests using the real authenticated-context type, SDK host imports and production executor. Missing grants, wrong assets, unknown recipients, insufficient balances, ceiling violations, insufficient or revoked allowances, wrong spender, duplicate initialization and malformed method inputs preserve storage and produce no successful effects. The registry binds all eight exports including initialization with the exact imported capability mask and dynamic spend descriptors. The committed WASM, interface and registry-value fixtures use program id 55 repeated 32 times; the interface digest is baf3663dba2ea72f17286fadcf4c060c6e9e41451a13b5b45e7fa1119e0a78ff."
