symbol = "programs-test programs-differential programs-lint agent-test-contract interop-test beta-ledger-check"
observed = "At this branch head, rebased onto the current base, the aggregate gates run green: make CC=gcc build/bin/layerxd build/bin/layerx-genesis-build, make CC=gcc test, the kernel and replay batch, the asset, escrow, ledger, reserve, gateway and bridge module batch, programs-core-test, programs-module-boundaries with programs-abi-drift, programs-differential, programs-lint, the six agent contract targets, the Go platform SDK suite and make beta-ledger-check all exit 0. make CC=gcc programs-test exits 0 across the whole locked programs workspace with no failing test, including the vendored parity-wasm and wasmi suites, the interpreter and sandbox suites, the C and AssemblyScript SDK targets, the registry reference tests and the native token and merchant replay. The AssemblyScript SDK package has to be installed out of band first because its Makefile recipe carries no install step."
