symbol = "request_parse send_proof_bundle lxp_daemon_deployment_encode assert_listener_authorization"
observed = "The lane source already handles tag 16 selector 4 through the maintained v2 deployment encoder. Rebuilt local native binaries pass all four registry native_deployment tests, including native activity/receipt/state binding, proof mutations, maintained current and historical heads, and canonical journal pairs. Real listener requests pass title-case, lowercase and mixed-case Authorization names; duplicate fields, malformed schemes, empty bearer, wrong bearer and missing bearer refuse. make layerxd layerx-genesis-build layerxctl test-daemon-lni-admission test-daemon-maintenance-protocol exits 0; registry cargo fmt --check, clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings and cargo test --no-fail-fast -- --test-threads=1 exit 0. Logs: qual-logs/au43d/native-make.log, registry-fmt.log, registry-clippy.log, registry-tests.log. Tests use LAYERX_TEST_NATIVE_BIN_DIR=/root/lx-lanes/authority/build/bin."
assumption = "This supersedes the current-source HTTP 401 in observation.6.8.117. The registry client presents the configured bearer with lowercase field names to the native loopback listener; no mTLS identity is used on that loopback HTTP test. Hosted registry ingress separately requires the gateway client certificate and registry request bearer. Exact bearer equality, duplicate refusal and request bounds remain enforced. Shared binaries outside the lane are unchanged; these focused passes do not qualify the cluster."

