observed = "formerly observation.5.1.41. formerly observation.5.1.44. formerly observation.5.1.7 (renumbered after rebase). formerly observation.5.1.focused-lock-reconciliation. cargo update --workspace --offline --manifest-path human/Cargo.toml and cargo update --workspace --offline --manifest-path agent/tests/qualify/Cargo.toml exit 0; logs qual-logs/r15/human-lock.log and qualify-lock.log. cargo metadata --locked --offline --manifest-path agent/Cargo.toml exits 0 for the complete workspace, with agent-metadata.json and agent-metadata.err. The same locked offline metadata command with --format-version 1 for human/Cargo.toml and agent/tests/qualify/Cargo.toml exits 0; human-metadata.json, qualify-metadata.json and their .err/.exit files retain evidence. No existing package version, source or checksum changes; no removals. Human changes only the layerx-mirror dependency edge base64 0.22.1 -> 0.23.1, required by interop/crates/layerx-mirror/Cargo.toml:9 and interop/Cargo.toml:24 (=0.23.1). Both versions were already locked. The qualify lock adds 79 previously absent package records; exact patch qual-logs/r15/qualify-lock.diff."
