assumption = "Task 5.1 needs an already provisioned authorized real stack to pass this gate; its current contract does not instruct the runner to create it. Task 5.2 owns setup, creating a prerequisite ordering issue for the orchestrator. Setting the flag alone does not establish a stack. Runner and task statuses remain unchanged; make human-qualify-faults was not rerun."
severity = "blocker"

