observed = "formerly observation.6.8.48. formerly observation.6.8.39. formerly observation.6.8.35. Sequence identity: the sink's contract (`Store::append_produced`, contiguous per-resource values from 1, existing test rejecting 1 → 3) is authoritative and stays. Each producer keeps a durable per-resource counter in its own outbox (the Redis outbox for the gateway, the journal-backed outbox for Human, the registry store for the registry), assigned when the fact is enqueued, contiguous from 1 per (kind, resource). The native ordering value — `ProtocolReceipt::global_sequence` for payments, the Human `StreamJournal` head for journeys/approvals, the registry publication version for programs — travels INSIDE the fact body as `source_sequence` (u64, informational, consumers may use it to order across resources) and is never used as the sink sequence. The fact id stays digest(kind, resource, producer sequence). Retries reuse the same enqueued entry, so the sequence is stable across restarts."
