[observation.6.8.7045]
task = "6.8"
file = "platform/hosted/identity/src/main.rs"
symbol = "event_producer_contract"
observed = "formerly observation.6.8.93. formerly observation.6.8.84. formerly observation.6.8.80. Identity principal resolver: implement `GET /internal/v1/principal` in `platform/hosted/identity/src/main.rs` and its durable authority store exactly as the registry client from pass 28 expects. Authentication is the caller's mounted internal service credential (same mechanism the gateway uses against identity today) plus the publication `LayerX-Key` header naming the key to resolve. Response is the authoritative `principal_digest` for that key, `404` when the key is unknown, `401`/`403` for a missing or unauthorised service credential, never a body-supplied principal. Register the registry as a permitted caller through the existing service-registration mechanism; no bearer-plane or ingress change. Tests: unit tests for the route in identity, and the registry positive delivery test against a real identity instance over the real TLS transport."
assumption = "Qualification is recorded separately from implementation decisions."
severity = "note"

[observation.6.8.7046]
task = "6.8"
file = "platform/hosted/tests/topology-regressions.py"
symbol = "event_producer_contract"
observed = "formerly observation.6.8.94. formerly observation.6.8.85. formerly observation.6.8.81. Topology count: `ok == 40` in `topology-regressions.py:42` counted the admitted edges declared before this branch. This branch declares ten new producer edges on purpose, each covered by a new refusal check. Set the literal to `50`, keep every original policy-removal negative case, and add one negative case per new edge class that asserts removing that policy drops the count and refuses the edge. This is not a weakening: the baseline is a count of declared edges and the declaration grew. Record the derivation (40 original + 10 producer edges) in the observation."
assumption = "Qualification is recorded separately from implementation decisions."
severity = "note"

[observation.6.8.7047]
task = "6.8"
file = "platform/hosted/identity/src/store.rs"
symbol = "event_producer_contract"
observed = "formerly observation.6.8.95. formerly observation.6.8.86. formerly observation.6.8.82. Publication keys are provisioned only by the existing provisioning service through POST /v1/publication-keys with the key in LayerX-Key and an existing subject plus explicit revoked flag in the body. The authority journal stores the SHA-256 digest of the publication key and its subject, rejects reassignment and resurrection after revocation, and derives principal_digest as SHA-256 of the stored subject. Resolution accepts no body and returns no principal from caller input. Store loss refuses resolution. The cluster provisioning path binds its issued program key through this authority."
assumption = "Qualification is recorded separately from implementation decisions."
severity = "note"

[observation.6.8.7048]
task = "6.8"
file = "platform/hosted/tests/topology-regressions.py"
symbol = "event_producer_contract"
observed = "formerly observation.6.8.96. formerly observation.6.8.87. formerly observation.6.8.83. The admitted-edge baseline is 40 original + 10 producer edges = 50. Including the two original Human edges gives 52. Original policy-removal negative cases remain. Each producer-policy removal must lower the admitted count and explicitly refuse its affected ingress edges."
assumption = "Qualification is recorded separately from implementation decisions."
severity = "note"

